  "label": "Each letter is represented by a diverse human figure",
  "description": "The text 'when each letter is awesome' is mapped onto the visual elements of the colorful human figures surrounding the globe. Each figure, in a different color, represents a 'letter' in the metaphorical sense, symbolizing that every individual or cultural component (each 'letter') is awesome and contributes to the global whole. This mapping is established through the visual arrangement and the textual message, creating an analogy where the human figures are the visual embodiment of the abstract concept of 'letters' being awesome.",
